@OpsPilot.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7170

### Log in — replace with your seeded admin credentials
POST {{OpsPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@opspilot.local",
  "password": "CHANGE_ME"
}

### Call with no token — should return 401
GET {{OpsPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Call with a token — paste the accessToken from the login response above
GET {{OpsPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

###
